### UC-03 Manage Branches - manual test requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
### 1) Run the request below, copy "accessToken" into @token, then run the others.
@host = http://localhost:5101
@token = paste-access-token-here
@branchId = paste-branch-id-here

### Get a SystemAdmin token (Development only - replaced by real login later)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/identity/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "SystemAdmin" }

### Create a branch
POST {{host}}/api/v1/identity/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AICOS Quận 1",
  "address": "1 Lê Lợi, Quận 1, TP.HCM",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "openingTime": "07:00",
  "closingTime": "22:00"
}

### List branches (search, status=Active|Suspended, page, pageSize)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/identity/branches?search=aicos&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one branch
GET {{host}}/api/v1/identity/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a branch
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/identity/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AICOS Quận 1 - Nguyễn Huệ",
  "address": "10 Nguyễn Huệ, Quận 1, TP.HCM",
  "phone": "+84901234567",
  "openingTime": "06:30",
  "closingTime": "23:00"
}

### Suspend a branch (or "Active" to reactivate)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/identity/branches/{{branchId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Suspended" }
